<title>USA: U.S. House Republicans set budget amendment vote.</title>
<headline>U.S. House Republicans set budget amendment vote.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>House Republican leaders Thursday said they have scheduled a vote on the balanced budget amendment for Feb. 26.</p>
<p>&quot;By scheduling an early vote on the balanced budget amendment, we in the leadership are making a statement that putting Washington's fiscal house in order is a top priority in the 105th Congress as well,&quot; House Republican Conference Chairman John Boehner, a Republican from Ohio, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
